            "review_title": "Review at Chilli Thái Vincom Grand Park",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n22\nDelicious Thai food in Grand Park\nDec 2024 • Friends\nWe just had lunch here today for two persons. The food was well presented, delicious, authentic Thai cuisine. \n\nEvery dish was yummy and spot on and the accompanying fruit based drinks were perfect. The only points lost were for service, you had to try hard to get the attention of the waiters or ask more than once for the same thing. Yes they were initially crowded, but this continued until after the crowd had died down.\n\nSo 4 out of 5 for the food, one point taken off for service from what would have been 5 out of 5.\nRead more\nWritten December 15, 2024",
